 monitoring.\n3. Analysis, diagnosis, and final report configuration.\n4. Report distribution, action planning, and executive presentations.\n\nEach phase of the project provides specific services for the client leveraged by the Perceptyx technology and facilitated by Project Managers.\n\nThe services included as part of the Perceptyx Insights Platform include the following:\n\n1. Ask Service - Point-in-time employee surveys to illuminate the employee experience\n2. Sense Service - Lifecycle surveys and always-on listening to keep pace with your people\n3. Dialogue Service - Crowdsourced insights to engage your people on the topics that matter most\n4. Develop Service - Multi-rater feedback to improve manager effectiveness and build leaders","event_log":[{"date":"2021-05-13T04:00:00.000Z","category":"Status Change","description":"Status set to Agency Authorization In Process","cert_type":"Rev5","cert_path":"Agency","cert_class":"Class C"},{"date":"2021-05-13T04:00:00.000Z","category":"Status Change","description":"Status changed from Agency Authorization In Process to FedRAMP In Process","cert_type":"Rev5","cert_path":"Agency","cert_class":"Class C"},{"date":"2022-07-12T04:00:00.000Z","category":"Status Change","description":"Status changed from FedRAMP In Process to FedRAMP Certified","cert_type":"Rev5","cert_path":"Agency","cert_class":"Class C"}]},"kept":{"annual_assessment":{"value":"05/13","as_of":"2026-04-14","source":"old_feed","shown_until":"2026-11-03","label":"Annual assessment"},"auth_date":{"value":"2022-07-12","as_of":"2026-04-14","source":"old_feed","shown_until":"2026-11-03","label":"Authorization date"},"fedramp_auth_date":{"value":"2022-07-12","as_of":"2026-04-14","source":"old_feed","shown_until":"2026-11-03","label":"FedRAMP authorization date"},"impact_level":{"value":"Moderate","as_of":"2026-04-14","source":"old_feed","shown_until":"2026-11-03","label":"Impact level"}},"timeline":[{"date":"2021-05-13","kind":"status","source":"status_log","from"